.TH GIT-FIND-TIME-TRAVELLERS 1 "2026-10-01" "Git Helpers" "git-helpers Manual"
.SH NAME
git-find-time-travellers \- find commits whose author and commit dates do not match
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B git find-time-travellers
[B-dR IDAYSR] [IrevR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBgit-find-time-travellers\fR lists commits where the commit date is more than
\fIDAYS\fR days later than the author date, or where the commit date is earlier
than the author date. This helps identify time-travelling commits that look
suspicious or were created with mismatched metadata.
.PP
The default threshold is 14 days, and the default revision is \fBHEAD\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -d , --days " " \fIDAYSR
Set the threshold in days.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show usage information.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B git find-time-travellers -d 30 HEAD
List commits where the commit date differs from the author date by more than 30 days.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git (1),
.BR git-log (1)
